    "notes": "brace-expansion DoS. Only remaining copy is node_modules/npm/node_modules/brace-expansion, inside the npm CLI's bundled dependency tree (pulled in by semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm). Bundled deps are frozen in npm's published tarball and cannot be reached by `overrides`; npm 12.0.2 still bundles 5.0.7. Release-time tooling only, never reachable from compiler or runtime code. Remove once npm publishes a release bundling brace-expansion >=5.0.9.",
